# Two replacement effects of one turn beginning (CR 614.10, 616.1): Ral Zarek's −7 has made Bot2 skip its next turn (one
# head of five), and Bot2's Time Vault is tapped ("If you would begin your turn while this artifact is tapped, you may skip
# that turn instead. If you do, untap this artifact"). Bot2, whose turn it is, chooses which applies, and chooses Time
# Vault: the turn is skipped and the Vault untaps. Ral's effect skipped nothing, so it waits for Bot2's next turn
# (CR 614.10a) and skips that one, with no question, as the Vault is untapped now. Turn 10 and turn 11 are Bot1's, and
# Bot2's turn after that is turn 12. Bot2 cast the Vault on turn 2 (it enters tapped) and took turns 4, 6 and 8, the
# default declining the Vault's offer.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Time Vault
Island x21

[Dice]
1; 2; 2; 2; 2

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer.Activate(Ability: Surveil)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Time Vault.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer.Activate(Ability: Surveil)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer.Activate(Ability: Surveil)
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer.Activate(Ability: Surveil)
[T9 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Time Vault.Tapped = True
Bot1.Battlefield.Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer.Activate(Bot2; Ability: Flip five coins)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.TurnsToSkip = 1
Bot2.Replace(Time Vault)
[T10 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Time Vault.Tapped = False
? Bot2.TurnsToSkip = 1
[T11 Bot1.Main1]
[T12 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Turn = 12
ActivePlayer = Bot2
Bot2.Battlefield.Time Vault.Tapped = False
